        "factor": "Verizon merger closure by Q1 2026",
        "direction": "down",
        "magnitude": "moderate",
        "rationale": "Timely close provides strategic liquidity runway and reduces near-term bankruptcy risk; calibrates probability downward."
      },
      {
        "factor": "Near-term debt maturities in 2026",
        "direction": "up",
        "magnitude": "strong",
        "rationale": "Upcoming maturities raise refinancing pressure; increases risk if the merger delays or financing conditions deteriorate."
