    "synthesis_rationale": "The updates from debt maturities, distress signals, and guidance withdrawal push risk upward, while the Verizon merger provides a substantial downward impulse via liquidity support. Due to correlation among several factors (e.g., distress signals and refinancing risk tied to the same liquidity dynamics) and calibration to a base-case anchor, the posterior converges toward essentially zero; the uncertainty range captures residual risk but remains narrow, reflecting a low-prior, high-corroboration assessment."
  }
}

